<view wx:if="{{visible}}" class="modal-overlay" catchtouchmove="preventD">
  <view class="modal-card">
    <view class="modal-header">
      <view class="host-avatar-badge">
        <text class="avatar-text">宫</text>
      </view>
      <view class="header-info">
        <text class="host-name">宫师姐发言</text>
        <text class="modal-title">Pawscars 比赛规则说明</text>
      </view>
      <view class="close-btn" bindtap="onClose">×</view>
    </view>
    
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="modal-body">
      <view class="rule-section">
        <view class="section-title">🏆 赛制全流程</view>
        <view class="rule-timeline">
          <view class="timeline-step">
            <text class="step-num">1</text>
            <view class="step-content">
              <text class="step-title">报名期（7天）</text>
              <text class="step-desc">提交爱宠单张照片，自动居中裁剪，可选一个或多个门类报名。</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="timeline-step">
            <text class="step-num">2</text>
            <view class="step-content">
              <text class="step-title">初选划屏（7天）</text>
              <text class="step-desc">三门类同页横向左右滑动，每类最多选8张。系统统计被选次数，前8名晋级。</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="timeline-step">
            <text class="step-num">3</text>
            <view class="step-content">
              <text class="step-title">8进4淘汰赛（7天）</text>
              <text class="step-desc">8强按主人ID字母顺序 (A→Z) 两两配对，4场1V1单败对决，胜者晋级4强。</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="timeline-step">
            <text class="step-num">4</text>
            <view class="step-content">
              <text class="step-title">4强巅峰德比（7天）</text>
              <text class="step-desc">4强之间两两对战（共6场循环赛），按总胜场与票数决出金银铜牌！</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="rule-section">
        <view class="section-title">⚖️ 打平判定规则</view>
        <text class="section-text">全阶段统一：若票数并列，以“谁先达到该票数的时刻更早（以选票时间戳为准）”判定胜出。</text>
      </view>

      <view class="rule-section">
        <view class="section-title">🔒 隐私与水印</view>
        <text class="section-text">所有参赛照片统一标注宠物名与打码主人ID（如 JE******），社群内可辨识同时保障个人隐私。</text>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="modal-footer">
      <button class="paw-btn paw-btn-primary full-btn" bindtap="onClose">我知道啦！继续比赛</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
